WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.644
Welcome to Holdfast, a home for your notes on your Mac.

00:00:03.644 --> 00:00:07.719
In this short tour, we'll find a decision, check its source, and

00:00:07.719 --> 00:00:09.251
make a change that you approve.

00:00:09.251 --> 00:00:12.467
Everything shown here uses fictional sample notes.

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:16.486
Start by choosing your notes folder and an answer model.

00:00:16.486 --> 00:00:22.000
In Settings, Local M L X is the default: it runs the model inside

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.440
Holdfast on your Mac.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:26.250
Download a model that fits your available memory.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:30.638
You can also connect Ollama, L M Studio, or a compatible server.

00:00:30.638 --> 00:00:33.831
A server receives the context needed for your request.

00:00:34.867 --> 00:00:38.060
The Library lets you browse your notes and read them in the app.

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:41.937
Here is our kitchen repair plan, with a budget and a few decisions.

00:00:41.937 --> 00:00:44.306
Your notes remain ordinary files.

00:00:44.306 --> 00:00:47.882
You can keep using your favorite editor alongside Holdfast.

00:00:48.867 --> 00:00:51.572
Open Ask and type a question your notes can answer.

00:00:51.572 --> 00:00:55.055
Let's ask: What did I decide about the kitchen repair?

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:58.352
Holdfast searches the notes and answers with sources.

00:00:58.352 --> 00:01:01.278
This answer was generated by a local model.

00:01:01.278 --> 00:01:04.831
We've removed the waiting time from this tour; the time you'll need

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:06.479
depends on your Mac and model.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:11.308
Open a numbered citation to read the source passage beside the answer.

00:01:11.308 --> 00:01:15.453
Here, we can check the repair choices and the eighteen hundred dollar

00:01:15.453 --> 00:01:17.183
budget against the original note.

00:01:17.183 --> 00:01:20.933
Treat the answer as a helpful starting point, and use the source

00:01:20.933 --> 00:01:22.105
to check the details.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:24.807
Now let's update the checklist.

00:01:24.807 --> 00:01:29.195
Ask: Mark Book the inspection as done in my home checklist.

00:01:29.195 --> 00:01:32.400
Holdfast prepares a proposal in the Inbox.

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:34.141
The file hasn't changed yet.

00:01:34.141 --> 00:01:37.659
Review the removed text in red and the replacement in green.

00:01:37.659 --> 00:01:40.341
You can edit the proposal before applying it.

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:43.376
Choose Apply Change to save it.

00:01:43.376 --> 00:01:46.742
Holdfast first saves a copy, then updates the note.

00:01:46.742 --> 00:01:49.262
Only the inspection checkbox changes.

00:01:49.262 --> 00:01:53.232
If someone has edited the note since the proposal was made, Holdfast

00:01:53.232 --> 00:01:56.843
refuses to overwrite it, so you can review a fresh proposal instead.

00:01:57.833 --> 00:01:58.808
Changed your mind?

00:01:58.808 --> 00:02:02.268
Open Recently filed in the Inbox and choose Undo.

00:02:02.268 --> 00:02:04.660
Holdfast restores the saved copy.

00:02:04.660 --> 00:02:08.270
We checked that this sample checklist returned exactly to its original

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:08.955
contents.

00:02:08.955 --> 00:02:12.589
Review, apply, and undo all stay under your control.

00:02:13.667 --> 00:02:14.874
You're ready to try it.

00:02:14.874 --> 00:02:18.241
Download the sample notes from the tour page, choose that folder

00:02:18.241 --> 00:02:20.854
in Holdfast, and ask the same kitchen question.

00:02:20.854 --> 00:02:22.595
Then try the checklist edit.

00:02:22.595 --> 00:02:26.415
The getting started guide walks you through installation, models,

00:02:26.415 --> 00:02:27.587
and your first question.
